WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.523
Teacher midterm practice, question 21.

2
00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:08.223
True or false: dislocations move most easily in a crystal along

3
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:12.546
the highest density planes, in the lowest density direction.

4
00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:18.636
The plane part is right. Slip happens on the most densely packed planes.

5
00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:23.144
But the direction is wrong. Slip runs along the most densely packed

6
00:00:23.144 --> 00:00:26.086
direction, where the atomic step is smallest.

7
00:00:27.685 --> 00:00:29.581
So the answer is B: false.

8
00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:33.741
Read the whole statement. One word, lowest, makes it false.
